Case: Invalid login is rejected
Goal: Verify that invalid credentials cannot sign in
Step: Fill "Email" with @email
Step: Fill "Password" with @invalidPassword
Step: Tap "Sign in"
Expect: text "Invalid credentials" is visible

Case: Search filters the catalog
Goal: Find the lamp and exclude unrelated products
Step: Fill "Email" with @email
Step: Fill "Password" with @password
Step: Tap "Sign in"
Expect: text "Find your favorite." is visible
Step: Fill "Search products" with "lamp"
Step: Dismiss keyboard
Expect: text "Desk Lamp" is visible
Expect: text "AirPods" is absent

Case: Quantity updates the total
Goal: Two lamps should cost 72
Step: Fill "Email" with @email
Step: Fill "Password" with @password
Step: Tap "Sign in"
Step: Tap "Open Desk Lamp"
Step: Tap "Add to cart"
Expect: text "Quantity: 1" is visible
Step: Tap "Increase Desk Lamp quantity"
Expect: text "Quantity: 2" is visible
Expect: number in id "cart-total" equals 72

Case: Removal empties the cart
Goal: Remove a lamp and verify the empty state
Step: Fill "Email" with @email
Step: Fill "Password" with @password
Step: Tap "Sign in"
Step: Tap "Open Desk Lamp"
Step: Tap "Add to cart"
Expect: text "Desk Lamp" is visible
Step: Tap "Remove Desk Lamp"
Expect: text "Your cart is empty" is visible
Expect: text "Desk Lamp" is absent

Case: Cart persists after relaunch
Goal: Restart the app and verify the saved cart
Step: Fill "Email" with @email
Step: Fill "Password" with @password
Step: Tap "Sign in"
Step: Tap "Open Desk Lamp"
Step: Tap "Add to cart"
Expect: text "Desk Lamp" is visible
Step: Relaunch
Step: Tap "Cart"
Expect: text "Desk Lamp" is visible
Expect: text "Quantity: 1" is visible
